# Baseline of the register at release 4.8.0 (before Lineage 29 was reopened at 4.9.0): the three profiles other than the agentic-adaptive one, the rule sets they include or the closed lineages adopted, and the 8 lineages then closed. States, lineage status, archive marks and version predicates are left out.
